        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: All My Life, One by One\n- People: Chris Shiflett\n- Organizations: Grammy Awards, Hot Modern Rock Tracks, Hot Mainstream Rock Tracks, Foo Fighters\n\nFacts:\n- The Foo Fighters song \"All My Life\" won a Grammy Award for Best Hard Rock Performance.\n- The Foo Fighters song \"All My Life\" spent ten straight weeks at number 1 on the Hot Modern Rock Tracks chart.\n- The Foo Fighters song \"All My Life\" peaked at number 3 on the Hot Mainstream Rock Tracks chart.\n- The Foo Fighters album \"One by One\" was the first Foo Fighters album to feature guitarist Chris Shiflett.",
